[1] CVE-2026-77812 — Cleartext exposure of DJI drone Wi-Fi credentials via BLE
CIRCL CNA; researchers Abdelrahman Yousef and Dr. Jordan Samhi credited. National Vulnerability Database / CVE, 21 Aug 2026. Source link
Concise summary	DJI DUML messages carried over BLE can expose Wi-Fi SSID, PSK, and a trusted identifier during normal connection/QuickTransfer workflows.
